'''The King & The Angel''' (伯爵と天使, ''Hakushaku to Tenshi'', '''Count and Angel''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[N-1 Grand Prix (Deadly)|N-1 Grand Prix]] and [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]] respectively. To unlock The King & The Angel, you must clear both King Wahwah's Revenge and Clionel Ascendant.

